Value BGP_ROUTER_ID (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value LOCAL_AS (\d+)
Value List NEIGHBOR (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value List BGP_VERSION (\d+)
Value List REMOTE_AS (\d+)
Value List MSG_RCVD (\d+)
Value List MSG_SENT (\d+)
Value List TABLE_VERSION (\d+)
Value List IN_QUEUE (\d+)
Value List OUT_QUEUE (\d+)
Value List UP_DOWN (\S+)
Value List STATE_PFXRCD (\S+)

Start
  ^BGP\s+router\s+identifier\s+${BGP_ROUTER_ID},\s+local\s+AS\s+number\s+${LOCAL_AS}
  ^${NEIGHBOR}\s+${BGP_VERSION}\s+${REMOTE_AS}\s+${MSG_RCVD}\s+${MSG_SENT}\s+${TABLE_VERSION}\s+${IN_QUEUE}\s+${OUT_QUEUE}\s+${UP_DOWN}\s+${STATE_PFXRCD} -> Record
